<package name="uutils-coreutils" project="openSUSE:Factory">
  <title>Rust rewrite of the GNU coreutils</title>
  <description>uutils aims to be a drop-in replacement for the GNU utils.
Differences with GNU are treated as bugs.

This package can replace GNU coreutils (Conflicts/Provides);
without Obsoletes the switch happens only on explicit install.
It installs the standard %{_bindir} utilities, man pages and
completions.</description>
  <url>https://github.com/uutils/coreutils</url>
</package>
